  "clean_decision_rule": "Among candidates with zero hard fidelity failures in strict cases and private takes, select the lowest private-take request-to-final p50; use p95 then cost as tie breaks. Exact accepted strings remain strict and separately reported. If none qualifies retain shipped Sol low; do not declare a winner.",
