        "intent_inference": {
          "1": "Misses or changes core intent",
          "2": "Mostly repeats or loosely reframes",
          "3": "Faithful clear intent with little additional conceptual precision",
          "4": "Sharpens intended mechanism, tradeoff or verification criterion without adding facts",
          "5": "Exceptionally precise intent clarification while retaining all core content"
        },
        "domain_register": {
          "1": "Wrong domain or unusable prose",
          "2": "Readable but casual or mostly verbatim",
          "3": "Clean professional prose with limited lexical upgrading",
          "4": "Crisp senior-practitioner register with correct terms of art",
          "5": "Outstanding high-signal domain-native phrasing"
        },
        "pairwise_rule": "At each matched case a faithful output beats a hard-failed output. Two hard-failed outputs are ineligible/tied. Among faithful outputs compare sum of builder intent and register ratings; equal ratings tie. Aggregate pairwise wins/losses/ties on the common 20-case subset, with denominators. No paid judge. Ratings and failure reasons frozen before identity map is read."
