  "limitations": [
    "Single operator, one draw per distinct case/lane, small short and long slices, no speaker/session holdout.",
    "Builder semantic and preference ratings are subjective; exact-accepted scores remain strict and are not relabeled by semantic judgment.",
    "Private references are MAI-derived silver and favor that transcription family; no independent listening or operator adjudication.",
    "No local inference, live app/config/keyring changes, build, native GUI, or real delivery proof in the study. Main owns code verification.",
    "OpenRouter :nitro routing and advertised prices can change. Current endpoint observations are dated sources, not a future SLO.",
    "Elevate is incomplete by explicit cutoff: 304 retained of 322 planned, one interrupted request and 17 unsubmitted. Common preference subset is 18 cases, not 20.",
    "The study client did not enforce production's shared 30s cleanup deadline. Four completed Argon responses exceeded it, and an unresolved Sonnet-low request required explicit client interruption. These are not production-path passes.",
    "Vocabulary arms were explicitly not run; no placement or noun-recall improvement is claimed."
  ],
